(49, NULL, NULL, 'Test Product Name', 'test-product-name', 14, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '1914.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'some good des here', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'some good info about test product', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-31 15:56:25', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(50, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container Transparent - 150ml', 'plastic-container-transparent-150ml', 15, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'Our Plastic Container Transparent – 150ml is the perfect solution for your food storage needs. Designed with a clear, rectangular shape, these disposable containers are not only visually appealing but also highly functional. Made from high-quality PP material, these containers are freezer safe, leak-proof, and stackable, ensuring your food stays fresh and organized.\n\\n\n\\n● <strong>Sturdy &amp; Strong:</strong> Durable construction for everyday use.\n\\n● <strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Secure lid prevents spills and leaks.\n\\n●<strong> Microwave Note:</strong> Safe for reheating food.\n\\n● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Suitable for storing food in the freezer.\n\\n●<strong> Packaging:</strong> Conveniently packaged for easy storage.\n\\n● <strong>End of Life:</strong> Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration\n\\n\n\\nIdeal for both takeaway and delivery, our Plastic Container Transparent – 150ml with Lid ensures easy transportation of solid and semi-solid foods. Store portions and also some of the leftovers effortlessly with these reliable containers. For more information, visit Disposable Bazaar.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, '150ml Transparent Rectangle, Disposable Food Storage Containers.\n\\n\n\\nFreezer safe, Leak-proof, Stackable.\n\\n\n\\nMicrowave-safe, Long-lasting.\n\\n\n\\nMade with transparent plastic.\n\\n\n\\nIdeal for storing hot-cold foods.\n\\n\n\\nMaterial : PP\n\\n\n\\nOur 150ml Plastic Container With Lid Disposable Box | R-650ml | Plastic Container | Transparent | Takeaway Box\n\\n\n\\n(Rectangle) is ideal for both takeaway &amp; delivery. The plastic frame ensures easy transportation of both solid as well as semi-solid food. You can also use our plastic containers to store portions &amp; leftover food in your refrigerator at home.', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-01-22 17:16:36', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(51, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container Transparent - 200ml', 'disposable-plastic-container-200ml/', 15, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600488401845.png', 'Plastic Container Transparent - 200ml', 'Plastic Container Transparent - 200ml', 'TRNS 200ml', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '-50.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Searching for a dependable way to save your food? Our Plastic Container Transparent – 200ml are the only ones you need. Made with an emphasis on both quality and ease of use, these disposable food storage containers are ideal for a range of applications.<br>● <strong>Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Built to withstand everyday use.<br>●<strong> Leak Proof:</strong> Prevents spills and messes.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note</strong>: Safe for reheating food.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Keeps food fresh for extended periods.<br>● <strong>Packaging:</strong> Conveniently packaged and stackable.<br>● <strong>End of Life:</strong> Recyclable for a sustainable environment.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FElTNhFn6ig', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 500 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2026-02-05 14:20:50', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
