(59, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container Round - R-16', 'disposable-r-16-round-plastic-container-16oz/', 15, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600909727019.png', 'Plastic Container Round - R-16', 'Plastic Container Round - R-16', 'TRNS R-16', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>For any food storage purpose, the Plastic Container Round – R-16 is the perfect choice. Your food will stay fresh and organized thanks to the freezer-safe, leak-proof, and stackable construction of this disposable Plastic Container Round – R-16. \r\n\r\nMade of sturdy PP plastic, they are safe to use in the microwave, making food reheating simple. The translucent plastic design makes it simple to quickly identify the contents, whether you are keeping hot or cold meals. You may also use these Plastic Container Round – R-16 to store leftovers and portions in your home refrigerator.</p><ul><li><b>Sturdy & Strong:</b> Durable construction for everyday use. </li><li><b>Leak Proof:</b> Secure lid prevents spills and leaks.  </li><li><b>Microwave Note:</b> Safe for reheating food. </li><li><b>Freezer Note:</b> Suitable for storing food in the freezer.  </li><li><b>Packaging:</b> Conveniently packaged for easy storage.\r\n</li><li><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-card-bg); color: var(--bs-card-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"><b>End of Life:</b></span><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-card-bg); color: var(--bs-card-color); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.</span></li></ul>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lfbVE7DsWS8', '<b>Pieces	</b>\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 500 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 15:09:32', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
