(65, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container 2 Portion Tray', 'disposable-plastic-container-2-portion-tray/', 15, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600475891573.png', 'Plastic Container 2 Portion Tray', 'Plastic Container 2 Portion Tray', 'TRNS 2 Portiom', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Presenting you our Plastic Container 2 Portion Tray, which is the best answer to all of your food storage problems! There are four separate sections on this glass rectangular tray, each holding 200ml, 500ml, 200ml, and 200ml of food.</p><p>Additionally, they endure a long time and are safe to use in the microwave, so your food stays tasty and fresh. Our Plastic Container 2 Portion Tray is great for takeout, delivery, and usage at home. It can hold both hot and cold meals. It is a useful addition to any kitchen because of its strong plastic frame, which makes it easier to transfer solid and semi-solid food.<br>● Sturdy & Strong: Durable construction for everyday use.<br>● Leak Proof: Secure lid prevents spills and leaks.<br>● Microwave Note: Safe for reheating food.<br>● Freezer Note: Suitable for storing food in the freezer.<br>● Packaging: Conveniently packaged for easy storage.<br>● End of Life: Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EL_FGrvFRaI', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 500 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 03:06:29', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(66, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container 4 Portion Tray', 'disposable-plastic-container-4-portion-tray/', 44, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600482845667.png', 'Plastic Container 4 Portion Tray', 'Plastic Container 4 Portion Tray', 'TRNS 4 Portion', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Presenting our Plastic Container 4 Portion Tray, the best answer to all of your food storage problems. There are four separate sections on this glass rectangular tray, each holding 200ml, 500ml, 200ml, and 200ml of food. These throwaway food storage containers are stackable, leak-proof, and made of premium PP material.\r\nAdditional Information\r\nAdditionally, they endure a long time and are safe to use in the microwave, so your food stays tasty and fresh. Our Plastic Container 4 Portion Tray is great for takeout, delivery, and usage at home. It can hold both hot and cold meals. It is a useful addition to any kitchen because of its strong plastic frame, which makes it easier to transfer solid and semi-solid food.\r\n</p><ul><li><strong>Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Durable construction for everyday use.\r\n</li><li><strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Secure lid prevents spills and leaks.\r\n</li><li><strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Safe for reheating food.\r\n</li><li><strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Suitable for storing food in the freezer.\r\n</li><li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Conveniently packaged for easy storage.\r\n</li><li><strong>End of Life:</strong> Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.</li></ul>', 1, 1, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0PXX4aGfHoY', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 200 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 03:18:04', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(67, NULL, NULL, 'Styrofoam Large Tray PP-17', 'disposable-styrofoam-thermopole-large-tray-pp-17/', 16, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601178266769.png', 'Styrofoam Large Tray PP-17', 'Styrofoam Large Tray PP-17', 'PP-17', 'white', '', 4, NULL, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'The Styrofoam Large Tray PP-17 stands as the top choice for those seeking a high-quality, reliable solution for food storage and presentation. This premium tray, renowned for its exceptional quality, is designed to cater to larger portions, making it perfect for both commercial and extensive personal use. Its robust styrofoam construction guarantees durability and consistent performance, ensuring that it can handle a variety of food types with ease. The large surface area of the tray is ideal for displaying a wide array of items, from substantial portions of fruits and vegetables to an assortment of bakery goods. It\'s also exceptionally well-suited for catering events, where its size and quality can make a significant difference in food presentation. The Styrofoam Large Tray PP-17 is a testament to functionality meets quality, offering a top-tier choice for all your food-serving needs.', 1, 1, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eRCj57dzUDM', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 300 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 22:37:06', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(68, NULL, NULL, 'Styrofoam Lunch Box 2 Portion PP-10', 'disposable-styrofoam-thermopole-lunch-box-2-portion-pp-10/', 16, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601180895848.png', 'Styrofoam Lunch Box 2 Portion PP-10', 'Styrofoam Lunch Box 2 Portion PP-10', 'PP-10', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>The Styrofoam Lunch Box 2 Portion PP-10 is a versatile and practical disposable Styrofoam Lunch Box 2 Portion PP-10 perfect for various settings, including workshops, homes, schools, and offices. Designed with three compartments, it can store a variety of hot and cold foods, ensuring they remain fresh and ready to eat. Made from durable styrene, these stackable boxes are microwave-safe and long-lasting, making them ideal for both takeaway and delivery. They are perfect for transporting solid and semi-solid foods securely.</p><p>●<strong> Sturdy & Strong: </strong>Constructed from high-quality styrene for durability.<br>● <strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Designed to prevent spills and leaks.<br>●<strong> Microwave Note:</strong> Safe to use in the microwave.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Suitable for storing in the freezer.<br>●<strong> Packaging: </strong>Conveniently packaged for easy handling and storage.<br>● <strong>End of Life: </strong>Dispose of responsibly to minimize environmental impact.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rfqGCnmfFks', '<b>Pieces	</b>\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 150 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 22:41:29', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(69, NULL, NULL, 'Styrofoam Lunch Box 3 Portion PP-21', 'disposable-styrofoam-thermopole-lunch-box-3-portion-pp-21/', 16, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601182727695.png', 'Styrofoam Lunch Box 3 Portion PP-21', 'Styrofoam Lunch Box 3 Portion PP-21', 'PP-21', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>The Styrofoam Lunch Box 3 Portion PP-21 is a versatile and practical disposable Styrofoam Lunch Box 3 Portion PP-21 perfect for various settings, including workshops, homes, schools, and offices. Designed with three compartments, it can store a variety of hot and cold foods, ensuring they remain fresh and ready to eat. Made from durable styrene, these stackable boxes are microwave-safe and long-lasting, making them ideal for both takeaway and delivery. They are perfect for transporting solid and semi-solid foods securely.</p><p>●<strong> Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Constructed from high-quality styrene for durability.<br>●<strong> Leak Proof:</strong> Designed to prevent spills and leaks.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Safe to use in the microwave.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Suitable for storing in the freezer.<br>● <strong>Packaging: </strong>Conveniently packaged for easy handling and storage.<br>●<strong> End of Life:</strong> Dispose of responsibly to minimize environmental impact.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cTqRNEwnl58', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 22:44:32', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000');
