(70, NULL, NULL, 'Styrofoam Shawarma Box PP-26', 'disposable-styrofoam-thermopole-shawarma-box-pp-26/', 16, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601185927330.png', 'Styrofoam Shawarma Box PP-26', 'Styrofoam Shawarma Box PP-26', 'PP-26', NULL, '', 4, NULL, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Offering our Shawarma Box (PP-26), the ultimate disposable Styrofoam container for all your food storage and transportation needs. Designed to be stackable and long-lasting, these boxes are perfect for both hot and cold foods. Microwave-safe and made from durable styrene, they are versatile enough for use in workshops, homes, schools, and offices. The sturdy Styrofoam frame ensures easy and secure transportation of both solid and semi-solid foods, making them ideal for takeaway and delivery. Additionally, these boxes are perfect for storing portions and leftover food in your refrigerator at home.</p><p>●<strong> Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Durable Styrofoam construction.<br>●<strong> Leak Proof</strong>: Secure lid prevents spills.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Safe for reheating food.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note: </strong>Suitable for storing food in the freezer.<br>● <strong>Packaging:</strong> Conveniently stackable for easy storage.<br>●<strong> End of Life:</strong> Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u2mFY_Cs48k', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 200 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 22:49:52', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
