(90, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container Black - C-1000ml', 'disposable-c-1000ml/', 17, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600971077508.png', 'Plastic Container Black - C-1000ml', 'Plastic Container Black - C-1000ml', 'BLK C-1000ml', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>C-1000ml Transparent Rectangle, Disposable Food Storage Containers.</p><p>Freezer safe, Leak-proof, Stackable.</p><p>Microwave-safe, Long-lasting.</p><p>Made with transparent plastic.</p><p>Ideal for storing hot-cold foods.</p><p>Material : PP</p><p>Our C-1000ml Plastic Container With Lid (Rectangle) is ideal for both takeaway & delivery. The plastic frame ensures easy transportation of both solid as well as semi-solid food. You can also use our plastic containers to store portions & leftover food in your refrigerator at home.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SjJTnhJqoKQ', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 250 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 16:51:47', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
