(111, NULL, NULL, 'Dips With Attached Lid - 1oz', 'disposable-attached-lid-dip-1oz/', 42, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600405788996.png', 'Dips With Attached Lid - 1oz', 'Dips With Attached Lid - 1oz', 'D - 1oz W/L', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Introducing our 1 Oz Dips with Attached Lid, the perfect solution for storing and transporting your favorite sauces and condiments. Made from durable PP material, these disposable dip containers are designed to be freezer safe, leak-proof, and stackable, ensuring long-lasting performance and convenience.<br>Additional Information<br>● <strong>Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Robust construction for reliable use.<br>●<strong> Leak Proof:</strong> Secure attached lid prevents spills.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Safe for reheating sauces.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Ideal for storing sauces in the freezer.<br>● <strong>Packaging:</strong> Conveniently packaged and easy to stack.<br>● <strong>End of Life:</strong> Recyclable for environmentally friendly disposal.<br>Perfect for pairing with meals on the go, our 1 Oz Dips with Attached Lid are a must-have for any kitchen. For more information, visit Disposable Bazaar.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=go0Ul4bJaKI', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 3000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 01:09:38', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
