(116, NULL, NULL, 'Cup With Lid - 80ml', 'disposable-cup-with-lid-80ml/', 45, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600245711833.png', 'Cup With Lid - 80ml', 'Cup With Lid - 80ml', '80ml W/L', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p></p><p>Enjoy convenience and hygiene with our <strong>Disposable Cup with Lid – 80ml</strong>, perfect for serving small beverages or desserts. Its compact size and secure lid make it ideal for takeaway coffee, tea, or sauces, ensuring no spills or leaks. Crafted from high-quality, food-safe material, it’s lightweight yet durable, offering a hassle-free solution for cafes, events, or home use. Whether you’re hosting guests or running a business, this cup adds practicality and ease to your service.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jYYPWhn0sdU', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 2000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 20:42:51', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
