(131, NULL, NULL, 'Sanitizer Gel - 70ml', 'sanitizer-gel-70ml/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600203735575.png', 'Sanitizer Gel - 70ml', 'Sanitizer Gel - 70ml', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '4.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"498\" style=\"width: 374pt;\"><tbody><tr height=\"17\" style=\"height:12.75pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"17\" class=\"xl65\" width=\"498\" style=\"height:12.75pt;width:374pt\">Introducing\r\n  our amazing Sanitizer Gel – 70ml which is indeed the perfect companion for\r\n  maintaining proper hygiene on the go! This compact and convenient bottle is\r\n  designed to fit easily in your bag or pocket, ensuring you can sanitize your\r\n  hands wherever you are. Our sanitizer gel is formulated to kill 99.9% of\r\n  germs and bacteria, providing effective protection with each use. The\r\n  quick-drying formula leaves your hands feeling clean and refreshed without\r\n  any sticky residue. Ideal for use at home, work, or while traveling, our 70ml\r\n  Sanitizer Gel is a must-have for anyone looking to stay safe and\r\n  healthy.<br>\r\n    Features<br>\r\n    ●        Compact Size: 70ml bottle\r\n  fits easily in bags or pockets.<br>\r\n    ●        Effective Protection: Kills\r\n  99.9% of germs and bacteria.<br>\r\n    ●        Quick-Drying Formula: Leaves\r\n  hands clean without sticky residue.<br>\r\n    ●        Versatile Use: Perfect for\r\n  home, work, and travel.<br>\r\n    ●        Easy to Use: Simply apply a\r\n  small amount and rub your hands together until dry.<br>\r\n    Stay protected and maintain your hygiene with our 70ml Sanitizer Gel. For\r\n  more information, visit Disposable Bazaar.<br>\r\n    </td></tr></tbody></table>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:32:53', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(132, NULL, NULL, 'Sanitizer Gel Pump - 500ml', 'sanitizer-gel-pump-500ml/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600206223338.png', 'Sanitizer Gel Pump - 500ml', 'Sanitizer Gel Pump - 500ml', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Introducing our Sanitizer Gel Pump – 500ml, an essential item for maintaining hygiene and safety. This sanitizer gel is designed for long-lasting use, featuring a convenient pump that dispenses just the right amount of gel to keep your hands clean and germ-free. Its 500ml size ensures it will last through numerous uses, making it ideal for both home and office settings. The Sanitizer Gel Pump formula is effective against a wide range of germs and is gentle on the skin, ensuring your hands stay soft and moisturized. Packaged in a sturdy, leak-proof container, it\'s easy to store and use.<br>Features<br>● <strong>Compact Size:</strong> 500ml bottle fits easily in bags or pockets.<br>●<strong> Effective Protection:</strong> Kills 99.9% of germs and bacteria.<br>● <strong>Quick-Drying Formula:</strong> Leaves hands clean without sticky residue.<br>●<strong> Versatile Use: </strong>Perfect for home, work, and travel.<br>● <strong>Easy to Use: </strong>Simply apply a small amount and rub your hands together until dry.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:37:02', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(133, NULL, NULL, 'Sanitizer Gel Pump - 280ml', 'sanitizer-gel-pump-280ml/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600205089673.png', 'Sanitizer Gel Pump - 280ml', 'Sanitizer Gel Pump - 280ml', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Introducing our Sanitizer Gel Pump – 280ml, an essential item for maintaining hygiene and safety. This sanitizer gel is designed for long-lasting use, featuring a convenient pump that dispenses just the right amount of Sanitizer Gel Pump to keep your hands clean and germ-free. Its 280ml size ensures it will last through numerous uses, making it ideal for both home and office settings. The gel formula is effective against a wide range of germs and is gentle on the skin, ensuring your hands stay soft and moisturized. Packaged in a sturdy, leak-proof container, it\'s easy to store and use.<br>Features<br>●<strong> Compact Size:</strong> 280ml bottle fits easily in bags or pockets.<br><strong>● Effective Protection:</strong> Kills 99.9% of germs and bacteria.<br>●<strong> Quick-Drying Formula: </strong>Leaves hands clean without sticky residue.<br>●<strong> Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for home, work, and travel.<br>●<strong> Easy to Use:</strong> Simply apply a small amount and rub your hands together until dry.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:35:08', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(134, NULL, NULL, 'Mist Sanitizer Spray - 1000ml', 'mist-sanitizer-spray-1000ml/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600201572715.png', 'Mist Sanitizer Spray - 1000ml', 'Mist Sanitizer Spray - 1000ml', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'The Mist Sanitizer Spray – 1000ml is a versatile and essential product designed to keep your hands and surfaces clean and sanitized. With a generous 1000ml capacity, this sanitizer spray is perfect for use in homes, offices, restaurants, and various other settings. Its fine mist spray evenly covers surfaces, providing effective sanitization. You can use it to sanitize your hands, frequently-touched surfaces, and objects. This mist sanitizer spray is formulated to kill germs and bacteria, helping to maintain a hygienic environment. Whether you\'re concerned about personal hygiene or want to ensure cleanliness in shared spaces, the Mist Sanitizer Spray – 1000ml is a valuable choice for keeping yourself and your surroundings safe and healthy.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:29:17', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(135, NULL, NULL, 'China Face Mask - 50 Pcs Box', 'china-face-mask-50pcs-box/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600193215689.png', 'China Face Mask - 50 Pcs Box', 'China Face Mask - 50 Pcs Box', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>The China Face Mask – 50 Pcs Box is an essential product for maintaining personal health and safety in various environments. Each box contains 50 disposable masks, ideal for daily protection against dust, pollen, smoke, and other airborne particles. These masks are designed for comfort and easy breathing, ensuring they can be worn for extended periods without discomfort. The elastic ear loops and adjustable nose clip provide a secure and snug fit for different face shapes and sizes. Perfect for use in public transport, shopping, offices, and crowded places, these masks are an effective barrier against potential contaminants. The disposable nature ensures hygiene, as each mask can be conveniently replaced after use. The China Face Mask – 50 Pcs Box is a valuable tool for anyone looking to protect themselves and others in public settings.</p><div><br></div>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:15:21', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(136, NULL, NULL, 'Local Face Mask - 50 Pcs Box', 'local-face-mask-50pcs-box/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17597430637976.png', 'Local Face Mask - 50 Pcs Box', 'Local Face Mask - 50 Pcs Box', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'Presenting our Local Face Mask, which comes in a handy 50-piece package? These face masks are indispensable for daily usage because they are made to be both comfortable and protective. Made from premium fabrics, they provide dependable filtration without sacrificing breathability. These masks are ideal for a variety of situations, such as attending events or doing errands, as they offer security and adhere to regional safety regulations. Our 50-piece package of Local Face Masks is a convenient and dependable option whether you are wanting to stock up for personal usage or company supplies.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<p><b>Pieces</b> 50-pcs</p>', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:08:50', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(137, NULL, NULL, 'Mist Sanitizer Spray - 120ml', 'mist-sanitizer-spray-120ml/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600199351058.png', 'Mist Sanitizer Spray - 120ml', 'Mist Sanitizer Spray - 120ml', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'The Mist Sanitizer Spray – 120ml is a convenient and portable sanitizer spray designed to keep you and your surroundings clean and germ-free. With its compact 120ml size, it\'s easy to carry in your bag or pocket, making it ideal for on-the-go use. This sanitizer spray emits a fine mist that effectively kills germs and bacteria on your hands and surfaces, helping to maintain a hygienic environment. You can use it to sanitize your hands, frequently-touched surfaces, and objects wherever you are. Whether you\'re traveling, at work, or in public spaces, the Mist Sanitizer Spray – 120ml is a valuable choice for ensuring personal hygiene and cleanliness on the fly.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:25:35', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
