ULL, 1, '0.000'),
(139, NULL, NULL, 'White Fork', 'disposable-white-fork/', 24, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600281995881.png', 'White Fork', 'White Fork', 'W FORK', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>With our sophisticated White Fork, which is ideal for any setting, you can elevate your eating experience. These White Forks are suitable for small gatherings as well as larger ones, and they come in several quantities:<br>●<strong> 1 piece</strong><br><strong>● 25 pieces </strong><br><strong>● 50 pieces</strong><br><strong>● 100 pieces</strong><br><strong>● a bulk option of 2000 pieces (Carton)</strong></p><p>Made from premium materials, they are long-lasting and have a pleasant grip, which makes them perfect for both formal events and informal dinners. Its sleek style gives your table setting a sophisticated touch while guaranteeing a fashionable and pleasurable dining experience.<br>●<strong> Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Designed to withstand rigorous use.<br>● <strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Ensures mess-free enjoyment of desserts.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Not suitable for microwave use.<br>●<strong> Freezer Note:</strong> Safe for storing in the freezer.<br>●<strong> Packaging: </strong>Conveniently packaged for easy storage.<br>● <strong>End of Life:</strong> Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 2000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 21:43:19', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(140, NULL, NULL, 'Transparent Spoon', 'disposable-transparent-spoon/', 24, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600319313728.png', 'Transparent Spoon', 'Transparent Spoon', 'T SPOON', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Introducing our Transparent Spoon, a versatile and practical choice for any dining occasion. Available in various quantities—1 piece, 25 pieces, 50 pieces, 100 pieces, and 2000 pieces (carton)—these disposable Transparent Spoons are made to meet your needs. Crafted from sturdy and strong materials, they are designed to handle both hot and cold foods without bending or breaking. While not suitable for microwave use, they are freezer safe, making them ideal for all types of meals.<br>● <strong>Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Built to withstand both hot and cold foods.<br>●<strong> Leak Proof:</strong> Ensures a mess-free dining experience.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Not suitable for microwave use.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Safe for storing in the freezer.<br>● <strong>Packaging:</strong> Available in various quantities for convenience.<br>●<strong> End of Life: </strong>Dispose of responsibility to minimize environmental impact.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 2000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 22:45:31', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(141, NULL, NULL, 'T/B Spoon White', 'disposable-t-b-spoon-white/', 24, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600318876790.png', 'T/B Spoon White', 'T/B Spoon White', 'W TB SPOON', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'Simplify your dining experience with our Disposable T-B Spoon – White. Designed for convenience and cleanliness, these spoons are perfect for both personal and professional use. Their durable build ensures they can handle a variety of dishes, from soups to desserts. The sleek white design complements any table setting, making them ideal for parties, catering events, or takeout. Lightweight and easy to dispose of, they help you save time on cleanup without compromising quality or style.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 3000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 22:44:47', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000');
