(142, NULL, NULL, 'T/B Spoon Black', 'disposable-t-b-spoon-black/', 24, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600318317506.png', 'T/B Spoon Black', 'T/B Spoon Black', 'B TB SPOON', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>The T/B Spoon Black is a versatile and durable disposable spoon, perfect for a variety of dining needs. Available in packs of 1, 25, 50, 100, or a carton of 3000 pieces, these T/B Spoon Black are ideal for both personal and large-scale events. Made from sturdy material, they ensure a reliable dining experience whether you\'re at a picnic, party, or simply enjoying a meal at home.</p><p>●<strong> Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Made from high-quality materials to withstand daily use.<br>● <strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Designed to prevent spills and leaks.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Not suitable for microwave use.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Safe to use for foods stored in the freezer.<br>● <strong>Packaging: </strong>Available in multiple pack sizes to suit different needs.<br>● <strong>End of Life:</strong> Dispose of responsibly to minimize environmental impact.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 3000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 22:43:51', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(143, NULL, NULL, 'Dessert Spoon (Mix)', 'disposable-ice-cream-spoon/', 24, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600315834845.png', 'Dessert Spoon (Mix)', 'Dessert Spoon (Mix)', 'DESSERT SPOON M', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Savor the ideal mix of style and utility with our Dessert Spoon (Mix). These stylish and long-lasting spoons are perfect for formal occasions as well as informal get-togethers. Offering a range of quantities (1 piece, 25 pieces, 50 pieces, 100 pieces, and a bulk option of 2000 pieces), they can accommodate any requirement, be it a modest dinner party or an elaborate celebration. Made from premium materials, these Dessert Spoons (Mix) improve the display of your delectable sweets while facilitating a flawless dining experience.</p><p><b>       Sturdy & Strong:</b> Designed to withstand rigorous use. </p><p>       <b>Leak Proof:</b> Ensures mess-free enjoyment of desserts.\r\n</p><p><b>Microwave Note:</b> Not suitable for microwave use.</p><p>       <b>Freezer Note:</b> Safe for storing in the freezer.\r\n</p><p><b>Packaging:</b> Conveniently packaged for easy storage.\r\n</p><p><b>End of Life:</b> Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.</p><p>       <b>Sturdy and elegant:</b> Crafted from high-quality materials to leave a lasting effect.</p><p><b>       Adaptable Quantities:</b> Depending on your requirements, select 1, 25, 50, 100, or 2000 units. </p><p><b>Perfect for Any Event:</b> ideal for formal and informal gatherings.</p>', 1, 1, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces	</b>\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 2000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 22:39:43', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(144, NULL, NULL, 'Soup Spoon', 'disposable-soup-spoon/', 24, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600317718884.png', 'Soup Spoon', 'Soup Spoon', 'SOUP SPOON', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'The Soup Spoon is a classic and essential utensil for enjoying soups, stews, and other liquid-based dishes. Its design features a deep and rounded bowl with a long handle, making it perfect for scooping up and sipping hot or cold soups. The soup spoon is not only practical but also adds a touch of elegance to your dining experience. It\'s commonly used in various cuisines worldwide and is a valuable addition to your cutlery collection. Whether you\'re savoring a hearty bowl of chicken noodle soup or indulging in a creamy bisque, the Soup Spoon is the ideal tool for relishing your favorite soups with ease and style.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 30 Pcs, 1500 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 22:42:51', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(145, NULL, NULL, 'Blue Shoppers', 'disposable-blue-shoppers/', 25, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601127079121.png', 'Blue Shoppers', 'Blue Shoppers', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Our Blue Shoppers are perfect for delivery as well as takeout. They provide simple handling and transportation of both solid and semi-solid objects. Additionally, you may use our Blue Shoppers to keep fruits and veggies fresh in your home refrigerator.</p><p><strong>Available sizes</strong><br></p><p><b>1. 1KG 10 x 14 = 400 Price</b></p><p><b>2. 1KG 12 x 16 = 400 Price<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b></p><p><b>3. 1KG 14 x 18 = 400 Price</b></p><p><b>4. 1KG 17 x 23 = 400 Price</b></p><p><b>5. 1KG 18 x 26 = 400 Price<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b></p><p><b>6. 1KG 20 x 30 = 420 Price</b></p><p><b>7. 1KG 24 x 36 = 420 Price</b></p><p><b>8. 1KG 30 x 40 = 440 Price</b></p><div><br></div>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<p><b>Size</b>	\r\n10×14, 12×16, 14×18, 17×23, 18×26, 20×30, 24×36, 30×40\r\n</p><p><b>\r\n\r\nWeight</b>	\r\n0.5 Kg, 1 Kg</p><p><b>1. 1KG 10 x 14 = 400 Price</b></p><p><b>2. 1KG 12 x 16 = 400 Price<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b></p><p><b>3. 1KG 14 x 18 = 400 Price</b></p><p><b>4. 1KG 17 x 23 = 400 Price</b></p><p><b>5. 1KG 18 x 26 = 400 Price<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b></p><p><b>6. 1KG 20 x 30 = 420 Price</b></p><p><b>7. 1KG 24 x 36 = 420 Price</b></p><p><b>8. 1KG 30 x 40 = 440 Price</b></p><div><br></div>', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 21:11:47', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(146, NULL, NULL, 'Aluminium Foil Jumbo - 45cm', 'aluminium-foil-jumbo-45cm/', 26, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601101736224.png', 'Aluminium Foil Jumbo - 45cm', 'Aluminium Foil Jumbo - 45cm', 'AL 18\" Jumbo', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Aluminium Foil 45 CM Jumbo</p><p>Aluminium Foil, Packaging Material.</p><p>Size: 45 CM Jumbo</p><p>Ideal for packing hot food</p><p>Material : Aluminium</p><p>Our Aluminium Foil 45 CM Jumbo is ideal for securely packing takeaways & deliveries to make sure the food remains piping hot. You can also use them to line baking trays as well as store portions & leftover food in your refrigerator at home.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A0uvmYbYTpM', '<br>', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 20:29:33', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
