(148, NULL, NULL, 'Deli 16oz', 'deli-16oz/', 27, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600345329043.png', 'Deli 16oz', 'Deli 16oz', 'Deli 16oz', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Introducing our Deli 16oz, the perfect solution for your food storage needs. These disposable Deli 16oz boxes are designed to be freezer safe, leak-proof, and stackable, ensuring convenience and reliability. Crafted from high-quality PP material, Deli 16oz are long-lasting and ideal for storing desserts and other foods. Whether for takeaway, delivery, or home use, these boxes are versatile and practical. Their sturdy and strong construction ensures easy transportation of both solid and semi-solid food items.<br>●<strong> Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Constructed from durable PP material.<br>● <strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Prevents spills and maintains freshness.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Not microwave-safe.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Safe for freezer storage.<br>● <strong>Packaging:</strong> Conveniently packaged for ease of use.<br>●<strong> End of Life: </strong>Dispose of responsibly to minimize environmental impact.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 300 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 23:28:52', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
