(154, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container Transparent - 1500ml (Rectangle)', 'plastic-container-transparent-1500ml-rectangle/', 15, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600494958026.png', 'Plastic Container Transparent - 1500ml (Rectangle)', 'Plastic Container Transparent - 1500ml (Rectangle)', 'TRNS 1500ml R', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>For all of your flexible food storage needs, the Plastic Container Transparent – 1500ml (Rectangle) is the best option available. Your food will stay fresh and organized thanks to the freezer-safe, leak-proof, and stackable construction of these disposable Plastic Container Transparent – 1500ml (Rectangle). They are perfect for delivery and takeout because of their transparent black style, which makes it simple to identify the contents.</p><p>● <strong>Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Durable construction for reliable use.<br>● <strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Secure lid prevents spills and leaks.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Safe for reheating food.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Keeps food fresh in the freezer.<br>● <strong>Packaging:</strong> Conveniently packaged for easy stacking.<br>● <strong>End of Life:</strong> Recyclable for environmentally friendly disposal.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces	</b>\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 250 Pcs, 150 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 03:38:15', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(155, NULL, NULL, 'Coffee Cup W/O Lid - 8oz', 'coffee-cup-w-o-lid-8oz/', 22, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600149604346.png', 'Coffee Cup W/O Lid - 8oz', 'Coffee Cup W/O Lid - 8oz', 'Coffee 8oz W/O LID', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>The Coffee Cup W/O Lid – 8oz is a practical and convenient option for enjoying your favorite hot beverages. Coffee Cup W/O Lid – 8oz made from durable paper, this disposable cup is leak-proof and stackable, ensuring easy storage and transportation. It is microwave-safe and designed to be long-lasting, making it perfect for both tea and coffee. The insulated double-wall design minimizes heat loss, keeping your drink warm for longer periods.<br>●<strong> Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Constructed from robust paper material.<br>● <strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Prevents leaks and spills efficiently.<br>●<strong> Microwave Note:</strong> Safe for microwave use.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Suitable for freezing.<br>●<strong> Packaging:</strong> Available in various pack sizes to meet different needs.<br>●<strong> End of Life:</strong> Dispose of responsibly to reduce environmental impact.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 500 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 18:02:40', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(156, NULL, NULL, 'Jar 1/5 Kg Pack of 12', 'jar-1-5-kg-pack-of-12/', 29, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601026738861.png', 'Jar 1/5 Kg Pack of 12', 'Jar 1/5 Kg Pack of 12', 'JAR 1/5 KG', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Our Jar 1/5 Kg Pack of 12, the perfect solution for all your food storage needs. These disposable food storage jars are made from high-quality transparent PP plastic, ensuring durability and long-lasting use. Designed to be freezer safe, leak-proof, and stackable, these jars are ideal for storing both hot and cold foods.\r\nAdditional Information </p><p><strong>Sturdy & Strong</strong>: Built to withstand everyday use.  </p><p><strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Secure seal to prevent spills and leaks. </p><p><strong>Microwave Note</strong>: Safe for reheating food. </p><p><strong> Freezer Note</strong>: Ideal for storing food in the freezer.\r\n</p><p><strong>Packaging:</strong> Comes in a convenient pack of 12.\r\n</p><p><strong>End of Life:</strong> Recyclable for environmentally friendly disposal.</p>', 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 18:24:33', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '12', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(157, NULL, NULL, 'Jar 1/4 Kg Pack of 12', 'jar-1-4-kg-pack-of-12/', 29, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601026417894.png', 'Jar 1/4 Kg Pack of 12', 'Jar 1/4 Kg Pack of 12', 'JAR 1/4 KG', NULL, '', 3, NULL, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-card-bg); color: var(--bs-card-color); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">The Jar 1/4 Kg Pack of 12 is a convenient and practical packaging solution for storing and preserving various food items and ingredients. With a pack of 12 jars, you\'ll have plenty of containers to use for organizing your kitchen essentials. Each jar is designed to hold 1/4 kg of contents, making it ideal for items like spices, herbs, condiments, or even small snacks. The airtight seal ensures that your ingredients stay fresh and flavorful for an extended period. Whether you\'re a home cook, baker, or simply need reliable storage containers, the Jar 1/4 Kg Pack of 12 is a valuable addition to your kitchen.</span></p><div><br></div>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 18:24:01', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '12', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(158, NULL, NULL, 'Jar 1/2 Kg Pack of 8', 'jar-1-2-kg-pack-of-8/', 29, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601026091974.png', 'Jar 1/2 Kg Pack of 8', 'Jar 1/2 Kg Pack of 8', 'JAR 1/2 KG', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'The Jar 1/2 Kg Pack of 8 offers an ideal solution for those in need of convenient, reliable storage options. Each jar in this pack has a 1/2 kg capacity, perfect for storing a variety of items such as kitchen ingredients, snacks, or even non-food items like craft supplies. These jars are a fantastic choice for both household and commercial use, providing a practical way to organize and preserve goods. The disposable nature of these jars makes them a hygienic choice, particularly suitable for one-time events or for businesses that prioritize cleanliness and efficiency. Lightweight yet durable, these jars are easy to handle and transport. This pack of 8 ensures you have enough storage, making the Jar 1/2 Kg Pack of 8 a valuable and versatile addition to any setting.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 18:23:29', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
