(164, NULL, NULL, 'Juice Cup W/O Lid - 12oz', 'juice-cup-w-o-lid-12oz/', 21, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601046275966.png', 'Juice Cup W/O Lid - 12oz', 'Juice Cup W/O Lid - 12oz', 'Juice 12oz W/O Lid', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>When it comes to enjoying your favorite juices on-the-go, convenience is key. That\'s why we\'re excited to introduce our Juice Cup W/O Lid – 12oz – the perfect solution for all your beverage needs.\r\nCrafted with practicality and durability in mind, our disposable juice cups are designed to make your life easier. Here\'s why they\'re a game-changer: </p><ul><li>Sturdy & Strong: Durable construction for everyday use. </li><li>Leak Proof: Designed to prevent spills and leaks. </li><li>Microwave Note: Not recommended for microwave use. </li><li>Freezer Note: Perfect for storing food in the freezer. </li><li>Packaging: Compact and stackable for easy storage. </li><li>End of Life: Recyclable for environmentally friendly disposal.\r\n</li></ul><p>Don\'t settle for anything less than the best when it comes to your beverages. Try our Juice Cup W/O Lid – 12oz today and experience convenience like never before.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 1000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 18:57:07', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(165, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Bucket - 1000ml', 'plastic-bucket-1000ml/', 28, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17597564294594.png', 'Plastic Bucket - 1000ml', 'Plastic Bucket - 1000ml', 'TRNS 1000ml BUCKET', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'The Plastic Bucket – 1000ml is a versatile and practical container suitable for a variety of uses. With its 1000ml capacity, this plastic bucket is ideal for storing and transporting liquids, small items, or even as a handy cleaning tool. The sturdy handle makes it easy to carry and pour, and the durable plastic construction ensures its longevity. Whether you\'re using it for household chores, gardening, or any other purpose, the Plastic Bucket – 1000ml is a valuable tool to have on hand. Its compact size and versatile design make it a convenient addition to your home or workspace.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 300 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 03:52:22', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(166, NULL, NULL, 'Coffee Cup Lid (Black)', 'coffee-cup-lid-black/', 31, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601081967382.png', 'Coffee Cup Lid (Black)', 'Coffee Cup Lid (Black)', 'COFFEE CUP LID', 'Black', '', 4, NULL, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Keep your coffee hot and spill-free with our sleek <strong>Coffee Cup Lid – Black</strong>. Perfectly designed for on-the-go lifestyles, this durable lid ensures every sip is as fresh and flavorful as the first. Its snug fit prevents leaks, while the black finish adds a touch of sophistication to your coffee cup. Whether you\'re commuting or enjoying a break, this lid is your perfect companion for a hassle-free experience.</p><p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Spill-resistant and leak-proof design</li><li>Sleek black finish for a professional look</li><li>Vent hole for smooth beverage flow</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: High-quality, food-grade plastic</li><li>Size: Fits standard 12oz, 16oz, and 20oz coffee cups</li><li>Eco-friendly and recyclable material</li></ul></li></ul><p>Enhance your coffee experience with this must-have accessory!</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 100 Pcs', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 19:56:36', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(167, NULL, NULL, 'Dome Lid 92mm With Punch', 'dome-lid-92mm-with-punch/', 31, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601082953825.png', 'Dome Lid 92mm With Punch', 'Dome Lid 92mm With Punch', 'DOME LID W/O PUNCH', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>The Dome Lid 92mm With Punch is a versatile and practical disposable lid designed to fit various containers and cups. With a 92mm diameter and a punch hole in the center, it provides a secure seal for compatible containers while allowing for the insertion of straws or stirrers. </p><p>The dome-shaped design is ideal for beverages with whipped cream or other toppings, ensuring that they remain intact during transport. Whether you\'re covering cups, containers, or bowls, these lids simplify the process of enjoying your drinks and food while on the go. Their disposable nature adds convenience, eliminating the need for washing and reusing lids. </p><p>The Dome Lid 92mm With Punch is a reliable and hygienic solution for sealing your beverages and food items.\r\n</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<p><b>Pieces<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-card-bg); color: var(--bs-card-color); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">1 Pcs, 100 Pcs</span></p>', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 19:58:15', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
