(169, NULL, NULL, 'F-1 Lid', 'f-1-lid/', 31, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601088912159.png', 'F-1 Lid', 'F-1 Lid', 'F-1 LID', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Our F-1 Lid is designed to provide a reliable seal for your food containers, ensuring that your meals stay fresh and protected. With its sturdy construction and dependable seal, you can trust our F-1 Lid to keep your food safe from spills and contamination.\r\nAvailable in convenient packs of 1 or 100 pieces, our F-1 Lid offers versatility and affordability. Whether you\'re storing leftovers at home or packing meals for delivery, our F-1 Lid is the ideal choice for all your food storage needs.</p><p><b>Sturdy & Strong</b>: Durable construction for everyday use.</p><p><b>Leak Proof:</b> Secure lid prevents spills and leaks. </p><p><b>Microwave Note</b>: Safe for reheating food.</p><p><b>Freezer Note:</b> Suitable for storing food in the freezer.</p><p><b>Packaging: </b>Conveniently packaged for easy storage. </p><p><b>End of Life:</b> Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.\r\n</p><p>Don\'t compromise on quality when it comes to keeping your food fresh. Choose the F-1 Lid for dependable performance every time.</p>', 1, 1, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 100 Pcs', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 20:08:11', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
