(173, NULL, NULL, 'Milky Lid 74mm', 'milky-lid-74mm/', 31, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601090423780.png', 'Milky Lid 74mm', 'Milky Lid 74mm', 'MILKY LID 74', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Presenting our Milky Lid 74mm, a dependable and adaptable container closing option. These lids, which come in packs of one or one hundred, fit snugly. They are powerful and long-lasting due to their construction from long-lasting materials. They are perfect for both hot and cold foods because of their leak-proof construction, which stops spillage. These Milky Lid 74mm offer great adaptability and are freezer safe, while not being microwave safe. These come in a convenient container that makes them easy to use for both personal and business needs. To lessen the influence on the environment, dispose of them properly when their time comes.\r\n</p><ul><li><b>Sturdy & Strong:</b> Constructed from durable materials for long-lasting use.\r\n</li><li><b>Leak Proof:</b> Designed to prevent spills and messes.\r\n</li><li><b>Microwave Note:</b> Not suitable for microwave use.\r\n</li><li><b>Freezer Note:</b> Safe for storing in the freezer.\r\n</li><li><b>Packaging:</b> Available in 1 piece or 100 pieces for convenience.\r\n</li><li><b>End of Life:</b> Give up on the need to reduce your influence on the environment.</li></ul>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 100 Pcs', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 20:10:42', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(174, NULL, NULL, 'Milky Lid 94mm', 'milky-lid-94mm/', 31, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601090771170.png', 'Milky Lid 94mm', 'Milky Lid 94mm', 'MILKY LID 94', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Presenting our Milky Lid 94mm, a dependable and adaptable container closing option. These lids, which come in packs of one or one hundred, fit snugly. They are powerful and long-lasting due to their construction from long-lasting materials. They are perfect for both hot and cold foods because of their leak-proof construction, which stops spillage. These Milky Lid 94mm offer great adaptability and are freezer safe, while not being microwave safe. These come in a convenient container that makes them easy to use for both personal and business needs. To lessen the influence on the environment, dispose of them properly when their time comes.</p><p> <strong>Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Constructed from durable materials for long-lasting use.\r\n</p><p><strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Designed to prevent spills and messes.\r\n</p><p><strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Not suitable for microwave use.\r\n</p><p><strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Safe for storing in the freezer.\r\n</p><p><strong>Packaging: </strong>Available in 1 piece or 100 pieces for convenience.\r\n</p><p><strong>End of Life:</strong> Give up on the need to reduce your influence on the environment.</p>', 1, 1, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 100 Pcs', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 20:11:17', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(175, NULL, NULL, 'Transparent Lid With Punch 92mm', 'transparent-lid-92mm/', 31, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601092016000.png', 'Transparent Lid With Punch 92mm', 'Transparent Lid With Punch 92mm', 'TRANSPARENT LID 92 PUNCH', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'The Transparent Lid 92mm is a versatile and practical disposable lid designed to fit various containers and cups. With a 92mm diameter, it provides a secure seal for compatible containers, preventing spills and preserving the freshness of your food and beverages. The transparent design allows you to easily identify the contents of your containers without the need to open them. Whether you\'re covering cups, containers, or bowls, these lids are a valuable addition to your kitchen or food service establishment. Their disposable nature adds convenience, eliminating the need for washing and reusing lids. The Transparent Lid 92mm is a reliable and hygienic solution for sealing your food and drinks.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 100 Pcs', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 20:13:21', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(176, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container Black - RFC-650ml', 'plastic-container-black-rfc-650ml/', 17, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601005377162.png', 'Plastic Container Black - RFC-650ml', 'Plastic Container Black - RFC-650ml', 'BLK RFC-650ml', 'Black', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"498\" style=\"width: 374pt;\"><tbody><tr height=\"17\" style=\"height:12.75pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"17\" class=\"xl65\" width=\"498\" style=\"height:12.75pt;width:374pt\">For all\r\n  of your flexible food storage needs, the Plastic Container Black – RFC-650ml\r\n  is the best option available. Your food will stay fresh and organized thanks\r\n  to the freezer-safe, leak-proof, and stackable construction of these\r\n  disposable containers. They are perfect for delivery and takeout because of\r\n  their transparent black style, which makes it simple to identify the\r\n  contents. They work just as well for preserving portions and leftovers in\r\n  your home refrigerator because of their durable plastic frame, which\r\n  guarantees simple transit of solid and semi-solid items.<br>\r\n    Additional Information<br>\r\n    ●        Sturdy & Strong: Durable\r\n  construction for reliable use.<br>\r\n    ●        Leak Proof: Secure lid\r\n  prevents spills and leaks.<br>\r\n    ●        Microwave Note: Safe for\r\n  reheating food.<br>\r\n    ●        Freezer Note: Keeps food\r\n  fresh in the freezer.<br>\r\n    ●        Packaging: Conveniently\r\n  packaged for easy stacking.<br>\r\n    ●        End of Life: Recyclable for\r\n  environmentally friendly disposal.<br>\r\n    </td></tr></tbody></table>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pCPj2x0BIAI', '<b>\r\nPieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 300 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 17:48:57', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(177, NULL, NULL, 'Styrofoam Sweet Tub PP-04', 'styrofoam-sweet-tub-pp-04/', 16, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601193185166.png', 'Styrofoam Sweet Tub PP-04', 'Styrofoam Sweet Tub PP-04', 'PP-04', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p><strong>Sweet Tub (PP-04),</strong> Disposable Styrofoam Boxes.</p><p>Stackable.</p><p>Microwave-safe, Long-lasting.</p><p>Ideal for storing hot-cold foods.</p><p>Can Be Used for Work Shop, Home, School, and Office.</p><p>Material: Styrene</p><p>Our <strong>Sweet Tub (PP-04) Styrofoam Box </strong>is ideal for both takeaway & delivery. The styrofoamframe ensures easy transportation of both solid as well as semi-solid food. You can also use our styrofoam boxes to store portions & leftover food in your refrigerator at home.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L_HFp-a9F-A', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 400 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 23:01:58', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000');
