(178, NULL, NULL, 'Styrofoam Medium Tray PP-08', 'styrofoam-medium-tray-pp-08/', 16, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601184444280.png', 'Styrofoam Medium Tray PP-08', 'Styrofoam Medium Tray PP-08', 'PP-08', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'Presenting the Styrofoam Medium Tray PP-08, an adaptable and useful answer to all of your food storage requirements. In addition to being durable and safe to use in the microwave, this stacking tray is also great for holding both hot and cold items. This tray is made to fit your needs, whether it is for your workplace, home, workshop, or school.\r\n\\n●<strong> Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Durable construction for everyday use.\r\n\\n●<strong> Leak Proof:</strong> Secure lid prevents spills and leaks.\r\n\\n● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Safe for reheating food.\r\n\\n●<strong> Freezer Note:</strong> Suitable for storing food in the freezer.\r\n\\n● <strong>Packaging:</strong> Conveniently packaged for easy storage.\r\n\\n●<strong> End of Life:</strong> Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.\r\n\\n\r\n\\nYou may also save leftovers and portions of food in your home refrigerator by using our Styrofoam Medium Tray PP-08 boxes. Experience the dependability and ease of use with the Styrofoam Medium Tray PP-08 available at Disposable Bazaar.', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0sva9r7kUpg', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 600 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 22:47:24', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(179, NULL, NULL, 'Straw White', 'straw-white/', 32, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601146787271.png', 'Straw White', 'Straw White', 'STRAW WHITE', 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'Introducing our White Disposable Straws, the perfect companion for your favorite soft drinks and juices. Made from high-quality PP material, these straws are designed for both takeaway and delivery, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable drinking experience. The bendable design adds an extra element of ease and comfort, making them ideal for any occasion. Whether you\'re hosting a party, running a cafe, or just enjoying a drink at home, our White Disposable Straws are a reliable choice. Enjoy the practicality and simplicity of our straws and elevate your beverage service today.', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IwaiORjWJwo', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 10000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 21:44:38', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(180, NULL, NULL, 'Juice Cup W/O Lid - 16oz', 'juice-cup-w-o-lid-16oz/', 21, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601061647938.png', 'Juice Cup W/O Lid - 16oz', 'Juice Cup W/O Lid - 16oz', 'Juice 16oz W/O Lid', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>16oz Juice Cup</p><p>16oz Juice Cup, Disposable Juice Cups.</p><p>Freezer safe, Leak-proof, Stackable.</p><p>Long-lasting.</p><p>Ideal for storing juices.</p><p>Material : PP</p><p>Our 16oz Juice Cup is ideal for both takeaway & delivery. The plastic frame ensures easy transportation of liquid juices. You can also use our plastic containers to store portions & leftover food in your refrigerator at home.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 1000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-10 19:22:44', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(181, NULL, NULL, 'Transparent Gloves 100 Pcs Pack', 'transparent-gloves-100-pcs-pack/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600207841268.png', 'Transparent Gloves 100 Pcs Pack', 'Transparent Gloves 100 Pcs Pack', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Our Transparent Gloves 100 Pcs Pack offers a practical solution for maintaining hygiene and cleanliness. Made from high-quality materials, this Transparent Gloves 100 Pcs Pack are sturdy and strong, ensuring durability during use. They are leak-proof, providing reliable protection against spills and contaminants. Although not suitable for microwave use, they are freezer safe, making them ideal for handling cold items. The packaging includes 100 gloves, neatly packed for easy storage and access. At the end of their life, dispose of them responsibly to help reduce environmental impact.</p><p>●<strong> Sturdy & Strong:</strong> Made from high-quality, durable materials.<br>● <strong>Leak Proof:</strong> Prevents spills and contamination.<br>● <strong>Microwave Note:</strong> Not suitable for microwave use.<br>● <strong>Freezer Note:</strong> Safe for handling items in the freezer.<br><strong>● Packaging: </strong>Contains 100 gloves per pack, easy to store.<br>● <strong>End of Life: </strong>Dispose of responsibly to minimize environmental impact.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:25', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:39:44', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
