(189, NULL, NULL, 'Ripple Cup With Cap - 8oz', 'disposable-coffee-cup-with-cap-8oz-2/', 22, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600169694920.png', 'Ripple Cup With Cap - 8oz', 'Ripple Cup With Cap - 8oz', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Ripple Cup With Lid</p><p>Ripple Cup With Lid, Disposable Food Storage Containers.</p><p>Leak-proof, Stackable.</p><p>Microwave-safe, Long-lasting.</p><p>Made with transparent plastic.</p><p>Ideal for tea & coffee.</p><p>Material : Paper</p><p>Our Ripple Cup 8oz With Lid is specially designed for holding hot drinks & making sure they stay warm. The insulated double-wall design minimizes external heat loss, keeping your drink hot for a longer duration. The lid comes with a tiny opening which allows you to sip on your favourite drink without any fear of spilling it.</p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 500 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:26', NULL, '2025-10-09 18:36:09', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
