(194, NULL, NULL, 'Paper Cup With Handle', 'paper-cup-with-handle/', 36, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601110918702.png', 'Paper Cup With Handle', 'Paper Cup With Handle', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'The Paper Cup with Handle is a practical and stylish solution for serving hot beverages. Designed with an ergonomic handle for easy grip, this disposable cup is perfect for tea, coffee, or hot chocolate, whether for personal use, cafes, events, or catering services.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pc, 25 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 2000 Pcs', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:26', NULL, '2025-10-10 20:44:51', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(195, NULL, NULL, 'Catering Box No. 1 (7 litres)', 'catering-box-no-1-7-litres/', 37, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17597567746983.png', 'Catering Box No. 1 (7 litres)', 'Catering Box No. 1 (7 litres)', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Keep your food fresh and secure with the versatile Catering Box No. 1, offering a generous 7-litre capacity. This durable and lightweight box is perfect for transporting and storing large quantities of food, making it an essential choice for catering businesses, events, and everyday kitchen use.</p><ul><li><b>\r\nLarge Capacity:</b> 7-litre size, ideal for holding bulk food items such as salads, curries, rice, and more.\r\n</li><li><b>Durable Construction:</b> Made from high-quality, food-grade plastic for reliable performance and longevity.\r\n</li><li><b>Secure Lid:</b> Comes with a tight-fitting lid to prevent spills and ensure freshness during transport.\r\n</li><li><b>Lightweight & Portable:</b> Easy to carry, making it perfect for catering services, picnics, or meal prep.\r\n</li><li><b>Versatile Usage:</b> Suitable for both hot and cold food items, making it a multi-purpose solution for your food storage needs.</li></ul>\r\n\r\nWhether you’re running a catering business or hosting a party, the Catering Box No. 1 is designed to handle your food storage and transportation with ease. Order now to enjoy the perfect combination of functionality and quality!', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pc, 12 Pieces', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:26', NULL, '2025-10-10 03:51:12', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(196, NULL, NULL, 'Catering Box No. 2 (3.1 Litres)', 'catering-box-no-2-3-1-litres/', 37, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17597567358543.png', 'Catering Box No. 2 (3.1 Litres)', 'Catering Box No. 2 (3.1 Litres)', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Transport and store your food effortlessly with the Catering Box No. 2, offering a convenient 3.1-litre capacity. Designed for practicality and durability, this catering box is perfect for restaurants, events, and home kitchens, ensuring your food stays fresh and secure.\r\n</p><ul><li><b>\r\nOptimal Capacity: </b>3.1-litre size, ideal for smaller portions of salads, curries, snacks, and more.\r\n</li><li><b>High-Quality Material:</b> Made from food-grade, BPA-free plastic for safe and long-lasting use.\r\n</li><li><b>Tight-Sealing Lid:</b> Includes a secure lid to prevent leaks and spills while keeping food fresh.\r\n</li><li><b>Lightweight Design: </b>Easy to handle and carry, perfect for catering, meal prep, or takeout.\r\n</li><li><b>Multipurpose Use:</b> Suitable for both hot and cold foods, making it a versatile storage solution.</li></ul>\r\n\r\nWhether you’re catering a small event or organizing your meals, the Catering Box No. 2 offers the perfect combination of convenience, reliability, and quality. Order now for secure and efficient food storage!', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pc, 12 Pieces, 36 Pieces', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:26', NULL, '2025-10-10 03:50:26', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(197, NULL, NULL, 'Straw Black', 'straw-black/', 32, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601146063302.png', 'Straw Black', 'Straw Black', 'N/A', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Straw Black,<span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-card-bg); color: var(--bs-card-color); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Disposable Straws. deal for soft drinks & juices.</span></p><p>Material : PP </p><p>Our Straw Black are used to accompany soft drinks & juices in takeaways & deliveries. The bendable design adds an element of ease to your dining experience.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IwaiORjWJwo', '<b>Pieces</b>	\r\n1 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 5000 Pcs (Carton)', 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:26', NULL, '2025-10-10 21:43:26', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', 2, 1, '0.000'),
(198, NULL, NULL, 'Juice Glass 210ml', 'juice-glass-210ml/', 21, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601062552373.png', 'Juice Glass 210ml', 'Juice Glass 210ml', 'JG-210ml', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, 'Serve your beverages with ease and style using our Juice Glass – 210ml. Perfect for juices, smoothies, and cold drinks, this lightweight and durable glass is designed for convenience. Its compact size makes it ideal for individual servings, whether at parties, cafes, or everyday use. Made from food-safe material, it’s both practical and disposable, ensuring a quick and hygienic cleanup. The crystal-clear design enhances presentation, making your drinks look as refreshing as they taste.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-31 23:58:26', NULL, '2025-10-10 19:24:15', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
