(228, NULL, NULL, 'Plastic Container Transparent - 150ml', 'disposable-plastic-container-150ml/', 15, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17600486784145.png', 'Plastic Container Transparent - 150ml', 'Plastic Container Transparent - 150ml', 'TRNS 150ml', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, NULL, NULL, 'Our Plastic Container Transparent – 150ml is the perfect solution for your food storage needs. Designed with a clear, rectangular shape, these disposable containers are not only visually appealing but also highly functional. Made from high-quality PP material, these containers are freezer safe, leak-proof, and stackable, ensuring your food stays fresh and organized.\r\nSturdy & Strong: Durable construction for everyday use.\r\nLeak Proof: Secure lid prevents spills and leaks. Microwave Note: Safe for reheating food. Freezer Note: Suitable for storing food in the freezer. Packaging: Conveniently packaged for easy storage. End of Life: Dispose of responsibility for environmental consideration.Ideal for both takeaway and delivery, our Plastic Container Transparent – 150ml with Lid ensures easy transportation of solid and semi-solid foods. Store portions and also some of the leftovers effortlessly with these reliable containers. For more information, visit Disposable Bazaar.', 1, 0, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DXasAu0z2j4', 'Pieces	1 Pcs, 50 Pcs, 100 Pcs, 500 Pcs (Carton), Custom Pcs', 1, '2025-01-06 16:46:26', NULL, '2025-10-10 03:24:38', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '5', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
