(230, NULL, NULL, 'Falooda Straws', 'falooda-straws/', 32, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601140533300.png', 'Falooda Straws', 'Falooda Straws', NULL, NULL, '', 4, NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, NULL, NULL, 'Falooda Straw, Disposable Straws.\r\n\r\nIdeal for soft drinks & juices.\r\n\r\nMaterial : PP\r\n\r\nOur Falooda Straw are used to accompany soft drinks & juices in takeaways & deliveries.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<p><b>Size<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-card-bg); color: var(--bs-card-color); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Small, Large</span></p>', 1, '2025-01-15 18:17:59', NULL, '2025-10-10 21:34:13', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(231, NULL, NULL, 'Surgical Gloves (100 Pcs Box)', 'surgical-gloves-100-pcs-box/', 23, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17597445279566.png', 'Surgical Gloves', 'Surgical Gloves', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, NULL, NULL, 'Stay safe and hygienic with our Surgical Gloves – 100 Pcs Box. These gloves provide excellent protection for medical, food handling, and cleaning tasks. Designed for a snug yet comfortable fit, they allow precise movements while ensuring your hands remain protected from contaminants. Made from durable, high-quality material, these disposable gloves are tear-resistant and easy to wear. Perfect for professionals and everyday users alike, they’re a reliable solution for maintaining cleanliness and safety.', 1, 1, 0, 'https://www.youtube.com/@disposablebazaar', '<b>Pieces	</b>\r\n100 Pcs', 1, '2025-01-15 19:42:45', NULL, '2025-10-09 19:01:37', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '5', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(232, NULL, NULL, 'HD Transparent', 'hd-transparent/', 25, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601122537707.png', 'HD Transparent', 'HD Transparent', NULL, 'sadfsadf', '', 4, NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '4700.00', NULL, '<p>Our HD Transparent are perfect for delivery as well as takeout. They provide simple handling and transportation of both solid and semi-solid objects. Additionally, you may use our HD Transparent to keep fruits and veggies fresh in your home refrigerator.</p><div><br></div><p><b>1. 1KG 4 x 5 = 520 Price</b></p><p><b>2. 1KG 6 x 7 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>3. 1KG 6 x 8 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>4. 1KG 7 x 9 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>5. 1KG 7 x 10 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>6. 1KG 8 x 12 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>7. 1KG 10 x 12 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>8. 1KG 10 x 14 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>9. 1KG 12 x 16 = 480 Price<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b></p><p><b>10. 1KG 12 x 18 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>11. 1KG 14 x 18 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>12. 1KG 18 x 24 = 480 Price<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b></p><p><b>13. 1KG 20 x 30 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>14. 1KG 24 x 36 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>15. 1KG 30 x 40 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>16. 1KG 30 x 50 = 480 Price</b></p><div><br></div>', 1, 0, 0, NULL, '<p><b>Size</b>	\r\n4 x 5, 6 x 7, 6 x 8, 7 x 9, 7 x 10, 8 x 10, 8 x 12, 10 x 12, 10 x 14, 12 x 16, 12 x 18, 14 x 18, 18 x 24, 20 x 30, 24 x 36, 30 x 40, 30 x 50</p><p><br></p><p><b>1. 1KG 4 x 5 = 520 Price</b></p><p><b>2. 1KG 6 x 7 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>3. 1KG 6 x 8 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>4. 1KG 7 x 9 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>5. 1KG 7 x 10 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>6. 1KG 8 x 12 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>7. 1KG 10 x 12 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>8. 1KG 10 x 14 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>9. 1KG 12 x 16 = 480 Price<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></b></p><p><b>10. 1KG 12 x 18 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>11. 1KG 14 x 18 = 480 Price</b></p><p><b>12. 1KG 18 x 24 = 480 Price<span style=\"white-