(233, NULL, NULL, 'Jar With Black Cap', 'jar-with-black-cap/', 29, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17603524622619.png', 'Jar With Black Cap', 'Jar With Black Cap', '–', NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, NULL, NULL, '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Jar With Black Cap, Disposable Food Storage Jars.</li>\r\n 	<li>Freezer safe, Leak-proof.</li>\r\n 	<li>Long-lasting.</li>\r\n 	<li>Made with transparent plastic.</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for storing hot-cold foods.</li>\r\n 	<li>Material : PET</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nOur Jar With Black Cap is ideal for both takeaway & delivery. The plastic frame ensures easy transportation of both solid as well as semi-solid food. You can also use our plastic jars to store portions & leftover food in your kitchen at home.', 1, 1, 1, NULL, '<p><b>Pieces	\r\nPack Of</b> 3, Pack Of 12\r\n</p><p><b>\r\nSize	\r\nSmall</b> (650ml), Large (750ml)</p>', 1, '2025-01-17 13:21:58', NULL, '2025-10-13 15:47:42', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '5', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(234, NULL, NULL, 'Zip Lock', 'disposable-zip-lock/', 25, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601127769422.png', 'Zip Lock', 'Zip Lock', NULL, 'white', '', 4, 1, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, NULL, NULL, '<p>Discover the convenience of our Zip Lock bags, designed for optimal food storage and transport. Crafted from durable LDPE material, these disposable Zip Lock bags are ideal for various purposes, from food delivery to personal use.</p><p>Available in sizes ranging from 5 x 7 to 10 x 14, they provide versatile options to suit your needs. With their secure seal, these bags are perfect for storing both hot and cold foods, ensuring freshness and flavor.</p><p><b>1. 1KG 5 x 7 = 700 Price</b></p><p><b>2. 1KG 6 x 8 = 700 Price</b></p><p><b>3. 1KG 8 x 12 = 700 Price</b></p><p><b>4. 1KG 10 x 14 = 700 Price</b></p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<p><b>Size</b>	\r\n5×7, 6×8, 8×12, 10×14\r\n</p><p><b>Weight	</b>\r\n0.5 Kg, 1 Kg</p><p><br></p><p><b>1. 1KG 5 x 7 = 700 Price</b></p><p><b>2. 1KG 6 x 8 = 700 Price</b></p><p><b>3. 1KG 8 x 12 = 700 Price</b></p><p><b>4. 1KG 10 x 14 = 700 Price</b></p>', 1, '2025-01-22 19:31:02', NULL, '2025-10-10 21:12:56', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '5', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
(235, NULL, NULL, 'White Shoppers', 'disposable-white-shoppers/', 25, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17601127426532.png', 'White Shoppers', 'White Shoppers', NULL, NULL, '', 4, 1, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, NULL, NULL, '<p>Our White Shoppers are the perfect disposable plastic bags for all your food delivery needs. Made from high-quality HDPE material, these White Shoppers are designed to be long-lasting and budget-friendly, making them an excellent choice for both takeaway and delivery services. The durable construction ensures easy transportation and handling of solid and semi-solid items, while their versatile design also makes them ideal for storing fruits and vegetables in your home refrigerator.</p><p><b>1. 1KG 10 x 14 = 470 Price</b></p><p><b>2. 1KG 12 x 16 = 470 Price</b></p><p><b>3. 1KG 14 x 18 = 470 Price</b></p><p><b>4. 1KG 17 x 23 = 470 Price</b></p><p><b>5. 1KG 18 x 26 = 470 Price </b></p>', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<p>Size	\r\n10×14, 12×16, 14×18, 17×23, 18×26\r\n</p><p>\r\n\r\nWeight	\r\n0.5 Kg, 1 Kg</p><p><br></p><p><b>1. 1KG 10 x 14 = 470 Price</b></p><p><b>2. 1KG 12 x 16 = 470 Price</b></p><p><b>3. 1KG 14 x 18 = 470 Price</b></p><p><b>4. 1KG 17 x 23 = 470 Price</b></p><p><b>5. 1KG 18 x 26 = 470 Price </b></p>', 1, '2025-01-22 19:34:07', NULL, '2025-10-10 21:12:22', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '5', NULL, 1, '0.000'),
