(240, NULL, NULL, 'Juice Glass 250ml Printing', 'juice-glass-250ml-pr/', 12, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17603704412469.png', 'muslim', 'muslim', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 4, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, '0.00', NULL, '<p>Upgrade your beverage service with our <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Juice Glass – 250ml</span>, perfect for juices, mocktails, and chilled drinks. Its 250ml capacity is ideal for generous single servings, making it suitable for cafes, events, or everyday use. The durable, food-grade material ensures safe handling, while the clear design enhances the visual appeal of your drinks. Lightweight and disposable, it provides a convenient, hygienic solution for quick cleanup without compromising on style or functionality. (printing)</p>', 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-13 20:47:21', NULL, '2025-10-13 20:49:31', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '5', 2000, 1, '100.000'),
(241, NULL, 49, 'Juice Glass 210ml Printing', 'juice-glass-210ml-pr/', 12, 0, '/storage/product_images/product_images-17603728159772.png', 'Juice Glass 210ml Printing', 'Juice Glass 210ml Printing', 'JG-210ml-printing', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, '0.000', '0.000', NULL, NULL, '0.000', 0, NULL, NULL, '<p>Serve your beverages with ease and style using our Juice Glass – 210ml. Perfect for juices, smoothies, and cold drinks, this lightweight and durable glass is designed for convenience. Its compact size makes it ideal for individual servings, whether at parties, cafes, or everyday use. Made from food-safe material, it’s both practical and disposable, ensuring a quick and hygienic cleanup. The crystal-clear design enhances presentation, making your drinks look as refreshing as they taste.</p>', 0, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-13 21:26:55', NULL, '2025-10-14 22:24:11', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '5', NULL, 1, '100.000'),
