eavy items: While our red cap jars are sturdy, avoid overloading them with heavy items to prevent damage to the jar or cap.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Handle with care: Treat your red cap jars with care and avoid dropping or mishandling them to prevent any potential cracks or breakage.</span></li>\r\n</ol>', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL),
