(31, 12, NULL, 'Lids', 'lids/', '/storage/category_icons/category_icons-17372296209319.png', NULL, '<h2>Lids in Karachi: Affordable and High-Quality Solutions</h2>\r\nFinding the right lids is essential for securely sealing containers, cups, and food packaging. In Karachi, you can access a wide variety of lids designed to meet diverse needs, from takeaway packaging to beverage containers. Whether you\'re running a restaurant, a food delivery service, or hosting an event, these lids ensure safety, freshness, and convenience.\r\n<h3>Types of Lids Available in Karachi</h3>\r\n<strong>Plastic Lids:</strong> Durable and lightweight, perfect for disposable cups, food containers, and more.\r\n<strong>Paper Lids:</strong> Eco-friendly options suitable for hot beverages like coffee and tea.\r\n<strong>Foil Lids:</strong> Ideal for sealing containers that require heat retention.\r\n<strong>Snap-On Lids:</strong> Secure fitting for spill-proof packaging, commonly used for sauces, dips, and desserts.\r\n<strong>Customizable Lids:</strong> Options for branding or specific size requirements to fit unique packaging needs.\r\n<h3>Why Choose High-Quality Lids?</h3>\r\n<strong>Leak-Proof Seal:</strong> Prevent spills and maintain food freshness.\r\n<strong>Food Safety:</strong> Keep food and beverages hygienically sealed.\r\n<strong>Versatile Applications:</strong> Suitable for hot and cold items, including soups, salads, and drinks.\r\n<strong>Eco-Friendly Options:</strong> Support sustainable practices with biodegradable and compostable lids.\r\n<h3>Lids Price in Karachi</h3>\r\nThe price of lids in Karachi varies depending on the material, size, and quantity. Plastic lids are typically more affordable, while eco-friendly and specialized lids may cost slightly more. On average:\r\n\r\n<strong>Plastic Lids:</strong> Starting from PKR 2-5 per piece (bulk discounts available).\r\n<strong>Paper and Eco-Friendly Lids:</strong> Starting from PKR 5-10 per piece.\r\n<strong>Foil Lids:</str